 on improving level flow and fixing a number of known issues.Full patch notes below:Bug FixesFixed an issue where continuing a run after a monster died in a new game would leave you with only 1 starting cardFixed the \"Expansion\" card's u","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:35:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694876","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4886270-1846651706680851","game_id":"steam-4886270","kind":"announcement","title":"HELAX demo IS NOW LIVE!","summary":"A world ravaged by Cognitive Scorch Syndrome.The deepest wounds buried in people's memories take shape as grotesque monsters within their minds, relentlessly eroding their sanity.Deformed cells. Exploding eyeballs. Severed limbs. Fire-scorched wastelands. Bodies reduced to ash...How much more suffering will this affliction, born of a war that never seems to end, bring upon humanity?Enter the Battlefield of HELAXAs a Pathfinder, you will venture into the depths of patients' minds, purge the mutat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:08:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680851","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4886270-1844115010496958","game_id":"steam-4886270","kind":"announcement","title":"The HELAX Playtest Has Begun!","summary":"Hello everyone!We are DUMO Game Studio, and our top-down action roguelite HELAX is now entering its official open playtest!📖 Story OverviewConsciousness Burn Syndrome has swept across the world, forcing humanity to enter consciousness sandboxes to eliminate pathogens.As a doctor, you’ll control the Lingshu Walker and venture into patients’ consciousness sandbox worlds. Hunt down living lesions, eliminate pathogens, and investigate the cause behind the outbreak of Consciousness Burn Syndrome.🎮 Ke","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T10:47:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496958","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4886270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:55:01Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:55:00Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4886270":"2026-10-26T14:55:01Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4886270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:55:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:55:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:55:00Z"},"5166100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:55:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:55:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:55:01Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4886270","app_id":4886270,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:04Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"5c912cd85272e4ce10452331bedee9c34f519b2337c7449818b99b9a3c1f28f3","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"《HELAX》, 독보적인 전략 구축 액션 슈팅 신작. 산산이 부서진 의식의 요계에 발을 들여놓고, '의료 기구'를 조종해 살아있는 병소를 사냥하라. 마인드번이 불러온 종말의 진실을 파헤쳐, '진짜' 병든 환자를 찾아내 구하라.","publishers":[{"name":"DUMO游戏"}],"developers":[{"name":"DUMO游戏"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"玩法展示","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1785067424","trailer_category":1,"micro